{30}{Back to Tarant! Then why in the name of the Void did ye' come with me and sail all the way out 'ere for? Do ye' enjoy takin' sailin' trips? Actually... [The Captain rubs his chin] That WAS a rather enjoyable trip. Hah! That storm sure was somethin' hey?}{Back to Tarant! Then why in the name of the Void did ye' come with me and sail all the way out 'ere for? Do ye' enjoy takin' sailin' trips? Actually... [The Captain rubs his chin] That WAS a rather enjoyable trip. Hah! That storm sure was somethin' hey?}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
